 in luna di miele con sua madre. In questo viaggio scopre di non conoscere sua madre e di amarla."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Honeymoon with My Mother","overview":"A young man is stood up at the altar. His overprotective mother decides to join him is what would have been his honeymoon, so as not to waste the trip. He ails while his mum enjoys the trip of her life."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"A José Luis (Quim Gutiérrez) acaban de dejarlo plantado en el altar, y por si esto fuera poco, Mari Carmen (Carmen Machi), su madre, se ha empeñado en acompañarlo a la luna de miel con la excusa de no perder el dinero. Cada minuto que pasan en Mauricio, José Luis se siente más infeliz y fracasado, mientras que Mari Carmen se lo pasa como nunca, viviendo todas las experiencias que siempre había deseado y revelándose como la maravillosa mujer que es en realidad, y que su familia no ve.","tagline":"¿Qué podría salir mal?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4T3K7Q1dtstp8yAH1c1otfia799.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s90hYiKk8vwCXKCDewFrrfzAdV6.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":955971,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4T3K7Q1dtstp8yAH1c1otfia799.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4T3K7Q1dtstp8yAH1c1otfia799.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4T3K7Q1dtstp8yAH1c1otfia799.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4T3K7Q1dtstp8yAH1c1otfia799.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmXaK4ajfTUOeb8K13uQ4fNfE8L.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zmXaK4ajfTUOeb8K13uQ4fNfE8L.jpg",